  Parameters: %{"background_tasks" => [], "cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/phx-new-generator", "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "6bc4851f-f735-4590-bb1c-c660619b4019", "hook_event_name" => "Stop", "last_assistant_message" => "Migration done and the harness is back up.\n\n**`code_my_spec_dev` now holds 100 stories** — the real 99 from `cli.db` plus 727, with 934 criteria and 556 rules. 993 payments, 994 servers, and 727 all verified present by name. The harness is connected and watching; the other two copies will re-attach on their next hook via the server lookup.\n\n**Three real defects surfaced getting here, and two are mine:**\n\n`MIX_ENV=dev_cli` reads `cli_dev.db`, not `cli.db` — that mapping is in `runtime.exs:54-58`. I ran the migration without checking it and moved a three-week-old database, which landed 60 stale stories that *looked* like a complete migration. That's the one that would have bitten you silently. Cleaned up by deleting those 60 and re-importing from the real source.\n\nTwo CLI migrations couldn't run at all: `ALTER COLUMN not supported by SQLite3`. Because the migrator is a supervised child, that isn't a failed migration — it's a CLI that won't boot. One was mine (`key_files_on_harness_and_path`), one came from main (`environments_timestamps_to_microseconds`). Both fixed and still uncommitted.\n\nAnd the data and the credential live in different databases: `cli.db` is the `prod_cli` store, so its OAuth token is for codemyspec.com and `localhost:4000` rejects it with a 401. That's why this had to be export-then-import rather than one command — worth knowing before the prod push, because the same split will apply in reverse.\n\n**Story 698** is gone — it existed only in `cli_dev.db`, so it wasn't in the real source and didn't come back. Say if you want it recovered from the dump.\n\nBackups in scratchpad if any of this needs reversing: `dev-before-migration.sql` (43MB) and `cli.db.before-migration` (258MB). `cli.db` itself was never written to.\n\nThe two migration fixes should be committed — they block the CLI for everyone, not just this run. Want those pushed now?", "permission_mode" => "default", "prompt_id" => "d3b49265-19c2-4599-96b5-2ecf97301c56", "session_crons" => [], "session_id" => "80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37", "stop_hook_active" => false, "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
