  Parameters: %{"cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/intake-on-home", "duration_ms" => 10, "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "d1c8f8f5-13e5-4827-865e-55a081f988a6", "hook_event_name" => "PostToolUse", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "4e2cbb76-dff8-4604-a181-cec0bcd8cfd3", "session_id" => "9703aaca-90cf-4469-8202-6146afe86064", "tool_input" => %{"file_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec/memory/project_marketing_nav_polish.md"}, "tool_name" => "Read", "tool_response" => %{"file" => %{"content" => "---\nname: Marketing nav needs deeper polish (revisit)\ndescription: Quick mobile fix shipped Apr 26 2026; broader nav overhaul still owed\ntype: project\noriginSessionId: 046b27fc-418e-4c8a-b8f3-fb0a52aac3ef\n---\nStory: shipped a hamburger + DaisyUI dropdown for the marketing layout's navbar in commit d2b8051 (lib/code_my_spec_web/components/layouts.ex). Mirrors the app layout's `lg:hidden` pattern. **Deliberately a quick fix** — user flagged \"we have to come back to this so remember.\"\n\nWhy: As of Apr 26, mobile rendering was crammed/broken. Needed something usable now.\n\n**Done in follow-up passes:**\n- ✅ Drawer + Products submenu (74ae77a)\n- ✅ App layout sidebar got user email + Log out (74ae77a)\n- ✅ Mobile overflow at 375px fixed by hiding logo wordmark + secondary auth on <sm; verified via vibium browser at 320/375/640/1280 (79da4c1)\n\n**Still owed:**\n- Active-state highlighting on current section (Method/Blog/Docs/Products). Needs `current_path` threaded through ~10 marketing-layout callers — `methodology.ex`, `metric_flow.ex`, `author_live.ex`, `onboarding.ex`, content show LVs, etc. Each call site needs `current_path={@current_path}` added.\n- Visual verification of the app-layout user/log-out section (deferred — would need driving the magic-link flow through vibium)\n- Headline overflow at 375px is a separate page-level issue, not a navbar one. Lives in the home LV / hero component, not in `layouts.ex`.\n", "filePath" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec/memory/project_marketing_nav_polish.md", "numLines" => 20, "startLine" => 1, "totalLines" => 20}, "type" => "text"}, "tool_use_id" => "toolu_01JRn1oWVZg6WreG64gHkoT4", "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec/9703aaca-90cf-4469-8202-6146afe86064.jsonl"}
